ticularly sought after for its collagen content. Additionally, you can enjoy various menus such as steamed flatfish, braised mackerel with aged kimchi, mulhoe, sashimi rice, and spicy soup.','17-1 Bukgun 3-gil, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','09:00~21:00',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 04:25:06','Flatfish sashimi / Steamed flatfish / Braised mackerel with aged kimchi / Mulhoe / Sashimi rice, etc.','Available Fee (Free)','Open year-round',NULL),(1137,1177,'en','Jeongrok Ssambap','Jeongrok Ssambap is located in Hwangnam-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. It has been featured in various broadcasts, including the MBC every 1 entertainment program. The exterior shows traces of time, and the interior creates a vintage atmosphere. There are group seating arrangements inside, making it suitable for various gatherings. The signature menu is Ssambap, and Jeju Pork Ribs Ssambap is also popular among many visitors. Additionally, it offers handmade Tteokgalbi, Cod Ribs Stew, Pajeon, and Kimchi Jeon. It is close to Gyeongju IC, and nearby famous tourist attractions include Cheomseongdae, the National Gyeongju Museum, and Gyeongju Gyochon Hanok Village.','48 Gyelim-ro, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','- 10:30~20:30- Preparation time 15:30~17:00',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 03:43:14','Pork Ssambap / Duck Bulgogi Ssambap / Beef Bulgogi Ssambap / Seafood Pajeon, etc.','Available Fee (Free)','Lunar New Year and Chuseok',NULL),(1138,175,'en','Gamasot Yangpun Rice Table','Gamasot Yangpun Rice Table is located in Bukgun-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. It features an antique exterior and an old-fashioned atmosphere. There are group seating arrangements inside, making it suitable for various gatherings. The signature menu is cockle + soy sauce crab set. Other dishes include abalone short rib stew, beef mushroom jeongol, aged kimchi short rib kimchi jeongol, and deodeok + mountain vegetable yangpun bibimbap. It is close to Gyeongju IC, and nearby are Bomun Tourist Complex and G