 etc.','Available Fee (Free)','Open year-round',NULL),(1147,1136,'en','Schumann and Clara','Schumann and Clara is located in Seonggeon-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. The modern exterior and clean interior create a striking atmosphere. Inside, there are group seating arrangements suitable for various gatherings. One entire wall is made into a display case, making it fun to browse various types of coffee and teacups. The signature menu is the master-recommended hand-drip coffee, and you can also taste various hand-drip coffees made from different beans. Additionally, you can enjoy a variety of drinks and bakery items such as direct-fire long black, affogato, and Irish coffee.','36-1, Hanbit-gil 36beon-gil, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','10:30~22:30',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 03:43:14','Americano / French chocolate mousse cake / rare cheesecake / double toast, etc.','Not available','Open year-round',NULL),(1148,1125,'en','1925 Gampo','1925 Gampo is located in Gampo-ri, Gampo-eup, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. The café was inspired by the year 1925 when Gampo Port opened. The interior is a remodeled space of an old bathhouse that had been closed for about 30 years. The exterior showcases a vintage charm combined with a modern sensibility. The emotional atmosphere created by the interior is notable. The signature drink is the Buoy Latte, which features a buoy floating on top. In addition, you can enjoy unique beverages and desserts such as Americano, Gampo Peach, Sannae Eoseo Oggok, Songdaemal\'s Afternoon, and Goara\'s Morning.','15-1, Gampoan-gil, Gampo-eup, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','- 09:30~18:00 - Last order 17:30',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 03:43:14','Buoy Latte / Yangnam Double Berry / Sannae Eoseo Oggok / Gampo Peach, etc.','Not available','Closed every Wednesday',NULL),(1149,1146,'en','Gyeongju Dangol Restaurant Main Branch','Gyeongju Dangol Restaurant Main Branch is a bulgogi specialty restaurant located in Chungnyeo-dong, Gyeongju, Gy