lable','Every Tuesday',NULL),(1151,1147,'en','Geumjanhwa Noodle','Geumjanhwa Noodle is a noodle specialty restaurant located in Bomun-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. The building, constructed in a traditional Hanok style, exudes a vintage atmosphere, and the neatly decorated interior provides a comfortable dining environment. There are also group seating options, making it suitable for family gatherings or various meetings. The signature dish is anchovy noodles, along with a variety of noodle dishes such as bibim noodles, cold noodles, knife-cut noodles, and perilla seed knife-cut noodles. Additionally, kimbap, chive pancakes, and steamed dumplings are available as side dishes.','115-1, Supmeori-gil, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','10:00~20:00 (Last order 19:30)',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 03:43:14','Anchovy noodles / Bibim noodles / Knife-cut noodles / Young radish noodles, etc.','Available','Every Thursday',NULL),(1152,1126,'en','Neul Gomtang','Neul Gomtang is located in Hwangnam-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. Built in a Hanok, it exudes an antique charm from its exterior. The interior also creates a nostalgic atmosphere. Inside, there are group seating arrangements, making it suitable for various gatherings. The signature dish is Neul Gomtang, made with beef short ribs simmered for over 12 hours. Other offerings include Neul Hanwoo Suyuk, Neul Hamburger Galbi, and Neul Kimchi Muri Muk Noodles. It is close to Gyeongju IC and surrounded by famous tourist attractions in Gyeongju, including Cheomseongdae, the National Gyeongju Museum, and Gyeongju Gyochon Hanok Village.','1st Floor, 986, Poseok-ro, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do','- 10:00~20:00 - Last order 19:20',NULL,'2026-09-16 03:43:14','2026-09-16 03:43:14','Neul Gomtang / Mountain Pile Galbi Gomtang / Naju Gomtang / Hanwoo Yukhoe Bibimbap, etc.','Available (Free)','Open year-round',NULL),(1153,1120,'en','Dalgabi','Dalgabi is located in Bomun-dong, Gyeongju, Gyeongsangbuk-do. Thanks to its traditional 